    'top-10-managed-it-services-companies-in-chennai', 'Top 10 Managed IT Services Companies in Chennai', 'Ten managed IT services companies headquartered in Chennai, chosen against five published criteria and listed alphabetically. A shortlist to check for yourself, not a ranking.', 'Managed IT', null,
    '[{"heading":"What this list is, and what it is not","paragraphs":["Managed IT services means a provider takes ongoing responsibility for part of your IT, usually monitoring, patching, backups, help for staff, and the network and security around them, under agreed response times. This guide lists ten companies headquartered in Chennai that sell it.","It is a shortlist to check for yourself, not a league table. We have not scored the companies or ranked them. They appear in alphabetical order, so position means nothing. Every statement about a company comes from its own website, or from its owner''s announcement where the entry says so, and was checked on 11 November 2026.","It is also not a complete directory. Other Chennai companies may meet the criteria below, and a company''s absence from this page says nothing about its quality.","Infeara Technologies publishes this guide and is one of the ten, because it meets the same criteria as the others. Its entry is written in the same way and sits in alphabetical order. Read it as you would read any other: check it against Infeara''s own website, not against this page.","For what a managed IT contract should cover, see [What managed IT actually covers](/insights/what-managed-it-actually-covers)."]},{"heading":"The criteria we used","paragraphs":["A company is listed only if all five of these are true:","- **Chennai headquarters.** The company, or its owner in a public announcement, gives Chennai as its head office.","- **Managed IT as a service line.** Its website describes ongoing operation or support of a customer''s IT, such as infrastructure monitoring, a service desk, network or security operations, or managed cloud. Selling products or writing software on its own does not count.","- **Business customers.** It serves organisations, not households.","- **Details you can check.** Its website says what it does and where it is, so a reader can verify each line in this guide.","- **Still operating.** Its website was live, and described current services, when we checked.","We did not use revenue, staff numbers, awards, reviews or advertising, and no company paid to be listed. None of those can be compared fairly from public pages, and an order built on them would claim more than we can show."]},{"heading":"Ten managed IT services companies in Chennai, A to Z","paragraphs":["Each entry says what the company says it does, where it is based, and links to its official website. Services are summarised from the company''s own pages, so check the site for the current scope.","### Accel IT Services (Accel Limited)","Accel Limited describes itself as a technology and media services group headquartered in Chennai, and Accel IT Services as its flagship business. It says it has three decades of experience in IT infrastructure managed services.","- **Services:** IT infrastructure services (maintenance, facility management and remote management), cloud solutions, cybersecurity including a managed security operations centre, and managed services covering data centre, cloud, print, security and network management.","- **Location:** Headquartered in Chennai, with a pan-India presence.","- **Official website:** [accelits.com](https://accelits.com/)","### Fourth Dimension Technologies (FourD)","An IT infrastructure and managed services provider. Its website says its teams have served banking, manufacturing, retail, software, telecom and BPO customers over 36 years, and describes the company as part of CEI. CEI''s 2024 announcement of the acquisition describes it as headquartered in Chennai.","- **Services:** Managed IT, with remote or on-site ownership of the infrastructure; cloud services including migration, backup and disaster recovery, and cloud managed services; managed security; infrastructure design and integration; and IT services for non-profits.","- **Location:** Chennai (Saidapet, Anna Salai). Its site also lists offices in Coimbatore and Campbell, California.","- **Official website:** [fourdtech.com](https://fourdtech.com/)","### Futurenet Technologies (India)","An IT consulting and services company that gives Chennai as its headquarters. Its website says it has been in IT services for more than two decades, and that it offers round-the-clock support for data centre and cloud infrastructure through remote infrastructure management, in a managed services model.","- **Services:** Remote and onsite infrastructure management, total IT infrastructure outsourcing, data centre and cloud services, networking, backup and information security, and end-user services.","- **Location:** Headquarters in Maduravoyal, Chennai. Other offices in Coimbatore and Puducherry, and in Sharjah, UAE.","- **Official website:** [futurenet.in](https://futurenet.in/)","### Infeara Technologies","The publisher of this guide: a small, technical company in Chennai whose primary practice is managed IT. It runs the day-to-day operation of customers'' infrastructure under an agreed service level, and starts every engagement with an assessment of what is already in place.","- **Services:** Managed IT (monitoring, patching, backup and recovery checks, incident response and monthly reporting), cybersecurity, cloud and data centre, network engineering, IT facility management, turnkey infrastructure projects, AI automations and application development.","- **Location:** Chennai, Tamil Nadu. Delivery is remote by default, with onsite attendance arranged where physical access is needed. It serves organisations across India.","- **Official website:** [infeara.com](https://www.infeara.com/)","### Inspirisys Solutions","An IT services company whose corporate office is in Chennai. Its infrastructure practice describes end-to-end services to create, run and manage IT infrastructure, including a managed IT service provider (MSP) offering.","- **Services:** Data centre managed services, managed IT services (MSP), network solutions, workplace transformation, tools and services automation, and audit and consulting. It also lists enterprise security, cloud, product engineering and warranty management practices.","- **Location:** Corporate office in Kilpauk, Chennai, with regional offices across India.","- **Official website:** [inspirisys.com](https://www.inspirisys.com/)","### Mentor Infocomm India","An enterprise IT, networking and cybersecurity company, headquartered in Chennai, that says it has supported organisations in education, banking, government, healthcare and IT services since 2012. Its managed IT page describes round-the-clock monitoring and support under customised plans.","- **Services:** Monitoring and support, server and network management, cybersecurity and threat protection, data backup and disaster recovery, and remote helpdesk support. It also lists IT and cloud infrastructure, networking, audio-visual integration and surveillance.","- **Location:** Head office on Greams Road, Thousand Lights, Chennai. It says it supports businesses across India.","- **Official website:** [mentorinfocomm.com](https://mentorinfocomm.com/)","### MSP Info Services","An IT infrastructure and services company headquartered in Chennai, with a branch office in Bengaluru. It says it has served organisations since 2020, supplying, deploying and supporting business technology, and describes managed IT as remote and onsite operational support for users, systems, networks, backup and vendors.","- **Services:** Managed IT services (remote helpdesk, monitoring and preventive maintenance, annual maintenance contracts, backup and security oversight, asset and vendor coordination), IT infrastructure, networks and wireless, cloud and Microsoft 365, end-user computing, security and surveillance, procurement and rental.","- **Location:** Headquarters in Velachery, Chennai, with a branch in Bengaluru.","- **Official website:** [mspinfoservices.in](https://www.mspinfoservices.in/)","### Net Access India","An IT infrastructure management company with its corporate office in Chennai, part of the Murugappa Group. Its website describes more than two decades of experience and managed services for infrastructure, end users and security.","- **Services:** IT infrastructure management (data centre, network management and transformation, and managed cloud on AWS and Azure), end-user support (help desk, onsite and on-call support, break-fix, asset and vendor management), managed cybersecurity and application support.","- **Location:** Corporate office on Moore Street, Chennai. Branch offices in Chennai (Taramani), Bengaluru, Pune and Delhi.","- **Official website:** [netaccess-india.com](https://www.netaccess-india.com/)","### Sify Technologies","An information and communications technology company headquartered at TIDEL Park in Taramani, Chennai. Its website describes more than 25 years in digital infrastructure, and a single provider for managed services across data centres, cloud, network and security operations.","- **Services:** Infrastructure managed services (data centre, cloud, network and security management, monitoring and maintenance), managed security services and managed detection and response, hybrid and multi-cloud management, network services and data centre colocation.","- **Location:** Headquarters in Taramani, Chennai. Its site also lists offices in Bengaluru, Hyderabad, Mumbai, Kolkata and Noida, and overseas.","- **Official website:** [sifytechnologies.com](https://www.sifytechnologies.com/)","### Sniper Systems and Solutions","An IT solutions provider headquartered in Chennai that says it has served businesses across India since 2009. Managed services sit alongside its infrastructure, cloud, device deployment and cybersecurity work.","- **Services:** IT infrastructure, cloud services, device deployment, cybersecurity, quick support, IT consulting, managed services and AV solutions.","- **Location:** Headquarters in Chennai, with offices in Bengaluru, Hyderabad, Gurugram, Coimbatore, Kochi and Vijayawada.","- **Official website:** [sniperindia.com](https://sniperindia.com/)"]},{"heading":"How to compare them","paragraphs":["Once you have two or three names, the useful questions are about scope and accountability, not size.","- **Scope.** What is covered and what is excluded? Ask for it in writing.","- **Response times.** What are the response and resolution targets, and how are they reported to you each month?","- **People.** Who is your named contact, and who picks up when something fails at night or at a weekend?","- **Backups.** How are backups checked, and when was a restore last tested?","- **Exit.** What documentation and access would you get back if you left?","- **Presence.** Which work is done remotely and which on site, and how soon can someone reach your office?","Ask for references from organisations of a similar size to yours, and speak to them. A reference you have spoken to is worth more than any claim on a website, including those summarised here."]},{"heading":"How this list is kept accurate","paragraphs":["Details were checked on 11 November 2026 against each company''s own website, and against its owner''s announcement where an entry names one. Companies change their services, offices and names, so confirm the current position with the company before you decide.","Company names belong to their owners. Being listed here is not an endorsement by, or a partnership with, any of them.","If an entry is wrong, or you run a managed IT company in Chennai that meets the criteria and is not listed, [tell us through the contact page](/contact). We will check it against your website and update this guide. It is the only version of this list, and we update it in place."]},{"heading":"Talk to Infeara about managed IT","paragraphs":["If you would like to talk about managed IT for your organisation, Infeara offers it as its primary practice: monitoring, patching, backup and recovery verification, incident response and monthly reporting, under service levels agreed in writing.","Work starts with an assessment of what you already run, and nothing is changed during the assessment. Delivery is remote by default, with onsite attendance arranged where it is needed, for organisations in Chennai and across India.","- [Read about Infeara''s managed IT services](/services/managed-it)","- [Send an enquiry to Infeara](/contact)","This section is the publisher''s own service enquiry. It is separate from the list above, which was made by the criteria in the second section."]}]'::jsonb, 1, '[{"label":"Managed IT Services","href":"/services/managed-it"},{"label":"Remote IT Services","href":"/services/outsourcing-remote-support"},{"label":"Managed Cloud Support Services (MSP)","href":"/services/cloud-datacenter/managed-cloud-support-msp"}]'::jsonb,
